        "note": "2,767 rows over 26 pollutants at one day type. 1,294 of them are what this chain emits today and every one of those is right to 8.201e-06; the other 1,473 are the five absences the description names. The blocks are 125 cohorts wide for the two energy-derived carbon pollutants, 124 for THC and N2O, and 104 for everything chained through a ratio table with no electricity row.",
